        "remember": "Check the actual selected settings and artifact identity before interpreting behavior.",
        "boundary": "A serial number explains matching, but an iOS artifact also has target, action, configuration, platform, and architecture coordinates. Device arm64 and simulator arm64 are different variants. Matching symbols permit attribution; they do not prove a root cause. The supplied settings and UUIDs are invented."
