        "remember": "Ready work still needs the right execution conditions, and finished work still needs an outcome check.",
        "boundary": "A run-loop mode is an event selection, not a tray, thread priority, or deadline. These finite host checks do not observe UIKit scrolling or device timing. A run loop can service many events, and making a timer eligible does not guarantee an exact firing time."
