        "androidBridge": "Kotlin suspend functions also suspend without inherently selecting a background dispatcher. MainActor resembles a declared UI isolation domain, while Dispatchers.Main familiarity does not imply atomicity across suspension. A canceled coroutine or Swift task can require cooperative checks and a separate freshness policy.",
