        "androidBridge": "Android app links, Keystore, TLS, and privacy reviews suggest trust-boundary questions. Universal-link association does not authorize parameters, Keychain is not a complete Keystore equivalent, and ATS, bearer authentication, and server authorization remain different iOS defenses.",
