        "scenario": "The title prefers 180 points, the badge 60, and spacing uses 12. The parent gives the row either 300 or 220 points. Choose horizontal priorities for the desired behavior.",
        "minutes": 5,
        "androidBridge": "ConstraintLayout and Compose measurement help frame size negotiation, but Swift intrinsic-size priorities are optional inequalities, not Kotlin layout weights or Compose hard constraints. Raising hugging does not raise compression resistance.",
