        "kind": "Design",
        "prompt": "Can a lower crash count and a dSYM rebuilt from the same commit justify closing the incident? What evidence is still needed?",
        "scenario": "The source commit matches, but MetricKit uploads are delayed. Fewer operations were attempted during the mitigation window.",
